						tempInvocationAction=tempInvocationAction+"LIFE: All allies in the light are granted healing from a single healing pool. The total healing available is "+tempInvokeValue8+" points. Any ally in the light can heal their wounds once per 10 seconds up to the value in the healing pool. If the healing pool is exhausted the invocation ends immediately. ";
						tempInvocationAction=tempInvocationAction+"HEROISM: All allies are -"+tempInvokeValue5+" to be hit (defensive), +"+tempInvokeValue5+" to hit and +"+tempInvokeValue5+" damage. In addition allies are immune to fear and are granted a +"+tempInvokeValue9+"% to CR. Ally morale rolls are made at +25%. ";
						tempInvocationAction=tempInvocationAction+"BANISHMENT: All Evil supernatural beings must make a CR once per 10 seconds or be banished to their home plane of origin. Also, any undead creatures are subject to the effects of Turn Undead at practitioner title "+tempInvokeValue10+" when entering or reentering the light. The Turn Undead effect (1d4 destroyed, 1d6 turned, etc.) is rolled once at the start of the invocation and then that number is applied to that type until the number is exhausted. ";
						tempInvocationAction=tempInvocationAction+"RESTORATION: Any ally in the circle afflicted by poison or disease is immediately cured. All allies regenerate all wounds and even lost limbs at a rate of "+tempInvokeValue11+" point(s) per 5 seconds. There is a "+tmpTotalPC+"% chance per 10 seconds that a dead former ally within the light will be resurrected. If this is successful the light (and the invocation) immediately fades. The resurrected are able to act immediately and are fully restored. The resurrected are at 2 levels of fatigue for the remainder of that day. ";
